{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 5 — Stalled Appointment Check\n\nRuns on schedule. **Direct from EasyBOP** (no Google Sheets).\n\n1. **POST** `/stage5/stalled-appointment-check`\n2. Downloads **Scheduling Register** for **each month** in lookback window\n3. Scrapes **OJS register** for the **same months** (month radio filter)\n4. Finds **Appointment Started** with no **Complete** OJS (operative + job + date)\n5. Checks **next-day** booking on same job\n\n**Email includes BOTH:**\n- Returning next day (multi-day OK)\n- Needs review (not scheduled to return)\n\n**Redeploy API** after `Stage5/` changes.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 580
      },
      "id": "a9aee6a1-2e82-42fc-8529-3496e607412b",
      "name": "Note — Stalled check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -64,
        -16
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f3578e27-9d58-48fa-9dd8-a85a2a14668f",
      "name": "Schedule every 2h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        144,
        432
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
